---
# Chatterbox-Turbo Container Properties
## Configures specific container behavior via a systemd-container drop-in file.
## This allows the server maintainer to override or protect specific settings
## (such as AutoUpdate policies) without modifying the primary container definition.

variant: fcos
version: 1.6.0

storage:
  files:
    - path: /etc/containers/systemd/chatterbox-turbo/chatterbox-turbo.container.d/properties.conf
      overwrite: true
      contents:
        inline: |
          [Container]
          # Enable automatic container image updates from the configured registry
          AutoUpdate=registry
      user:
        name: root
      group:
        name: root
      mode: 0644
